{
  "name": "Child of Fate",
  "slug": "child-of-fate",
  "class": "Dragoneer",
  "subclass_feature": "Core Concept",
  "summary": "TBA",
  "introduction": [
    "Burdened by the weight of prophecy or a predetermined fate, the child of fate is protected by the universe around them. Happenstance bends and light protects them as they live, granting their actions aid and keeping them healthy. They can pass this protection on to others in the form of holy light, mending their wounds and healing them. However, such a power comes with a price, as the child of fate is all too often bound to walk toward an end they have no control over."
  ],
